{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChL8Ejs25wE2JVhts8r2a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the overflow in `styles.css`. I haven't viewed it at 375px in a browser, so the fix is untested.\n\nThe `.cta` button had three problems:\n- **Fixed width:** `width: 420px` plus 48px of horizontal padding and a 4px border was wider than a 375px screen minus the card's 16px side padding.\n- **No wrapping:** `white-space: nowrap` stopped the long label from wrapping onto a second line.\n- **Box sizing:** the default content-box sizing added the padding and border on top of the width.\n\nI made these changes to `.cta`:\n- `width: 100%` with `max-width: 420px`, so it fills the card on phones and still caps at 420px on desktop.\n- `box-sizing: border-box`, so the padding and border count inside that width.\n- `white-space: normal`, so the label wraps.\n- `display: block`, which I added so the width rules apply cleanly. The button now sits on its own line, as before."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":580,"cache_read_input_tokens":22756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":580},"output_tokens":315,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24827d61-b740-4129-9e67-b83d5c436539","uuid":"1f908b89-4489-4bc1-9863-adeaf91c16bd","timestamp":"2026-11-23T15:50:33.177Z","request_id":"req_011ChL8EjdcwteoqVjzM57cg"}
